Usage:
  /usr/bin/ostree rev-parse [OPTION?] REV

Output the target of a rev

Help Options:
  -h, --help        Show help options

Application Options:
  --repo=PATH       Path to OSTree repository (defaults to current directory or /sysroot/ostree/repo)
  -S, --single      If the repository has exactly one commit, then print it; any other case will result in an error
  -v, --verbose     Print debug information during command processing
  --version         Print version information and exit

